/-- Sum of the three incoming TVs on the open off-axis ray (0,v).
Paper `203e554`, `eq:small-bv-incoming-estimate`, lines 1368–1376;
Luk–Oh (5-31), p. 1633, BV interval convention pp. 1608–1609.
The printed log ν is interpreted as log(−ν), since ν < 0. Luk–Oh measures are
evaluated on half-open intervals (u₁,u₂] (p. 1609), and the axis point u = v is not in
Christodoulou's domain, so the TV is over (0,v). -/
@[expose] noncomputable def smallBVIncomingTV (S : SSFields) (v : ℝ) : ℝ≥0∞ :=
  eVariationOn (fun u => S.dupsi u v / S.nu u v) (Ioo 0 v) +
  eVariationOn (fun u => S.phi u v) (Ioo 0 v) +
  eVariationOn (fun u => Real.log (-S.nu u v)) (Ioo 0 v)

end AcExtensionPrinciple

